cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TCSpecial: flight software relaying telemetry and commands between payloads and an operations center"
abstract: >-
  TCSpecial is flight software that relays commands and telemetry between
  a vehicle's payloads and a remote operations center, designed for
  spacecraft several light seconds away and the unreliable links they
  have. What a vehicle carries and does is a configuration file, checked
  before it runs, joining payloads, computations, logs and gateways as a
  graph of nodes. It runs as a fault domain of its own under a supervisor
  that restarts it and falls back to the last configuration that ran,
  and comes with a payload simulator, a test ground station, a
  configuration editor and checker, and ground-station libraries for C,
  C++, Rust and Python.
authors:
  - name: "TCSpecial Team"
version: 0.3.1
date-released: 2026-11-17
